+<h3 id="transcript-spillover">Transcript spillover</h3>
+<p>The secondary cell-type weight (<code>w2</code>) estimates the
+fraction of transcripts attributed to a contaminating neighbouring cell
+type, serving as a proxy for transcript spillover.</p>
+<div class="sourceCode" id="cb8"><pre class="sourceCode r"><code class="sourceCode r"><span id="cb8-1"><a href="#cb8-1" tabindex="-1"></a>plot_df_w2 <span class="ot">&lt;-</span> <span class="fu">bind_rows</span>(</span>
+<span id="cb8-2"><a href="#cb8-2" tabindex="-1"></a>  atera<span class="sc">@</span>meta.data  <span class="sc">%&gt;%</span> <span class="fu">select</span>(weight_second_type) <span class="sc">%&gt;%</span> <span class="fu">mutate</span>(<span class="at">dataset =</span> <span class="st">&quot;ATERA&quot;</span>),</span>
+<span id="cb8-3"><a href="#cb8-3" tabindex="-1"></a>  xenium<span class="sc">@</span>meta.data <span class="sc">%&gt;%</span> <span class="fu">select</span>(weight_second_type) <span class="sc">%&gt;%</span> <span class="fu">mutate</span>(<span class="at">dataset =</span> <span class="st">&quot;Xenium&quot;</span>)</span>
+<span id="cb8-4"><a href="#cb8-4" tabindex="-1"></a>)</span>
